le format. Fees for services already provided remain payable. Draft invoices already in your Xero stay there.\n\n## 10. Ownership\n\n10.1 Your data, your customer lists and your brand belong to you.\n\n10.2 Our workflows, templates, prompts and know-how belong to Keystone. While the agreement runs you may use them for your business. They are not resold or shared.\n\n10.3 With your written permission (Schedule 1), we may describe our results for you anonymously or as a case study. We will never share your customers' details.\n\n## 11. Confidentiality\n\nEach of us keeps the other's confidential information private and uses it only for this agreement, during it and for 2 years after it ends (longer for personal data and trade secrets).\n\n## 12. General\n\n12.1 **Changes** to this agreement must be agreed in writing (email is fine) by both of us.\n\n12.2 **Complaints:** email [Keystone email]. We will acknowledge within 2 working days and aim to resolve within 10.\n\n12.3 **Subcontracting:** we may use subcontractors and the sub-processors in Schedule 2, and stay responsible for their work.\n\n12.4 **Whole agreement:** this agreement and its schedules are the whole agreement between us about the services.\n\n12.5 **Law:** this agreement is governed by the law of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales decide any dispute.\n\nSigned for Keystone: ______________________ Bilal Latif Khan  Date: ________\n\nSigned for the Client: ______________________ Name / role: ______________________  Date: ________\n\n---\n\n## Schedule 1 – Services and fees\n\n**Setup fees (one-off, per service, no VAT)**\n\n| Service | Included | Setup fee |\n|---|---|---|\n| Invoice Automation (invoices auto-drafted in Xero when a job is completed, plus payment chasing) | [Yes/No] | £1,750 |\n| AI Phone Booking (answers calls, books jobs, flags urgent calls and complaints) | [Yes/No] | £1,250 |\n| Quote Calculator (instant quotes by phone, form or manually) | [Yes/No] | £1,250 |\n| R